{"claims": [{"text": "07:46:07 [telegram] autoSelectFamily=true (default-node22)", "line": 648, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "07:46:07 [telegram] dnsResultOrder=ipv4first (default-node22)", "line": 649, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "07:47:33 [telegram] autoSelectFamily=true (default-node22)", "line": 772, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "07:47:33 [telegram] dnsResultOrder=ipv4first (default-node22)", "line": 773, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "07:48:44 [telegram] autoSelectFamily=true (default-node22)", "line": 855, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "07:48:44 [telegram] dnsResultOrder=ipv4first (default-node22)", "line": 856, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "(это реально самая важная настройка для Telegram-ботов).", "line": 1208, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "Это уже **MVP системы записи**.", "line": 1599, "entities": ["Booking"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "Если хочешь, дальше я покажу **самую важную настройку OpenClaw**, которая резко улучшает ботов в Telegram (она меняет стиль ответа модели). Это реально **самая сильная фича**.", "line": 1633, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "Отвечу **по-продуктовому**, без теории. У тебя уже есть **MVP AI-администратора для клиники**. Теперь задача — **быстро превратить это в деньги**. 💰", "line": 1645, "entities": ["Dental Clinic", "Administrator"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "Found groupPolicy=\"open\" at: - channels.telegram.groupPolicy Risky tool exposure contexts: - agents.defaults (sandbox=off; runtime=[exec, process]; fs=[read, w…", "line": 2281, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "CRITICAL Telegram DMs are open", "line": 2283, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "* Telegram `OK` / `connected` / `ready` [OpenClaw+1](https://docs.openclaw.ai/help/troubleshooting?utm_source=chatgpt.com)", "line": 2592, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "Это уже превращает систему в **реальный инструмент для клиник**.", "line": 2827, "entities": ["Dental Clinic"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "16:49:17 [telegram] autoSelectFamily=true (default-node22)", "line": 2876, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "16:49:17 [telegram] dnsResultOrder=ipv4first (default-node22)", "line": 2877, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "telegram sendMessage ok chat=7752881406 message=295", "line": 2989, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "`telegram sendMessage ok ... message=285`", "line": 3502, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "`telegram sendMessage ok ... message=287`", "line": 3503, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "`telegram sendMessage ok ... message=289`", "line": 3504, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "`telegram sendMessage ok ... message=291`", "line": 3505, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "`telegram sendMessage ok ... message=293`", "line": 3506, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "`telegram sendMessage ok ... message=295`", "line": 3507, "entities": ["Telegram"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "Отправка работает, приём хромает. По логам у тебя есть `deleteWebhook failed`, а это часто ломает